+  mismatched entry
+- selected Stage 2 tree:
+  `307b6ed87dc5bc4e1dc2ad5cb5e93175ceaee471bd108df435162f3180a98c9e`
+- Stage 3 manifest:
+  `0613373deb260cba14df9e940f9ecd8364dffac7b49c3f4925b970136a4a0ef8`
