+  `41268b3e75eedc21db6588eb7801dec0de0cc72aa12025487b7fce7ef7afd553`
+- mounted producer-source tree:
+  `55e6319f2271365637d561f055caa2f6187aa98b0216ec39cc79e0cce33b867c`
+
+The mandatory producer gate passes:
